<LegalPage
  title="Privacy policy"
  updated="24 July 2026"
  description="What Renaissance & Co. collects, why, and your choices."
>
  <p>
    This policy explains what information Renaissance &amp; Co. Investments (“we”, “us”) collects
    when you use this website or contact us, why we collect it, and the choices you have.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Details you give us.</strong> When you call, message us on WhatsApp, or otherwise
      enquire, we receive the contact details and information you choose to share — such as your
      name, phone number, and what you are looking for.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Usage and device data.</strong> Standard technical information (such as browser type
      and pages viewed) collected to keep the site working and understand how it is used.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Advertising measurement.</strong> If we run campaigns on Meta (Facebook and
      Instagram), the Meta Pixel may record that you visited this site or took an action here, so we
      can measure and improve those campaigns. This uses cookies and similar technologies.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your enquiry and provide the advisory service you asked about.</li>
    <li>To operate, secure, and improve this website.</li>
    <li>To measure and improve our advertising.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Meta</strong>, in connection with advertising measurement, where the Pixel is active.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Bellavierre</strong>, our exclusive UAE partner, where sharing is necessary to
      progress an enquiry about a UAE transaction — and only as needed to do so.
    </li>
    <li>Service providers who help us operate the site, under appropriate confidentiality terms.</li>
    <li>Authorities where we are legally required to disclose.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    The site uses essential cookies to function and, when advertising is active, measurement cookies
    via the Meta Pixel. You can control cookies through your browser settings; blocking some may
    affect how the site works.
  </p>

  <h2>Retention and your choices</h2>
  <p>
    We keep enquiry information for as long as needed to help you and to meet our legal obligations,
    then delete it. You may ask us to access, correct, or delete the personal information we hold
    about you.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p class="note">
    To make a privacy request, contact us at [privacy contact email — to be added]. The identity and
    registered details of the data controller will be added here once entity registration completes.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
